                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2762676,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But as demand grew, the smelting process required huge factory furnaces or fires to melt the metal from the rock, and there was not enough coal in the local area, so the rocks containing minerals had to be shipped long distances.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 168.37502,
                  "from": 153.06999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2762718,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Sadly, in the twentieth century, the great port of Manham declined, and thousands of workers were forced to emigrate out of the area.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 177.91,
                  "from": 169.655,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2762742,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The building at the port fell into disrepair, and the place became almost forgotten. But then the Manham Trust was formed to conserve the historical resources of the area. It organized scores of local volunteers to remove undergrowth to find the original outlines of the installations. It then brought in paid professionals to match installations with maps of the original port complex and to set about reconstructing it. Today, you can see the results of this ambitious program of restoration.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2762743,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The building at the port fell into disrepair, and the place became almost forgotten.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 183.67001,
                  "from": 178.47,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2762758,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "But then the Manham Trust was formed to conserve the historical resources of the area.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 189.43,
                  "from": 184.47,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2762774,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It organized scores of local volunteers to remove undergrowth to find the original outlines of the installations.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 197.695,
                  "from": 190.335,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2762792,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It then brought in paid professionals to match installations with maps of the original port complex and to set about reconstructing it.",
