                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 2762828,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "The intention, and we believe this will be realized before the end of the year, is to return Manham Port to the condition it reached at its peak as the greatest copper port in the country.",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 2762829,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The intention, and we believe this will be realized before the end of the year, is to return Manham Port to the condition it reached at its peak as the greatest copper port in the country.",
